cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software-code
message: "Cite this repository at the commit or tag you read. Version v0.1.0 is the first public version: the smallest coherent first cut, twenty-one Comparator entries at one commit on one Mathlib pin. No Erdős problem in it is claimed solved, and no entry has been peer reviewed."
title: "Plectis Erdős Lean"
authors:
  - family-names: "Cook"
    given-names: "Will"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: "Lean 4 formalizations of 21 partial results across 8 open Erdős problems (#68, #243, #249, #251, #257, #269, #1041, #1049). Each entry states a theorem, proves it against Mathlib with no sorry on the proof side, prints the axioms it depends on, and records in its metadata what the theorem does not reach. None of the problems is claimed to be solved, and novelty is recorded as unassessed wherever the literature does not settle it."
keywords:
  - "Lean 4"
  - "formal mathematics"
  - "number theory"
  - "Erdős problems"
  - "irrationality"
  - "polynomial geometry"
  - "proof verification"
repository-code: "https://github.com/wcook04/plectis-erdos-lean"
version: "v0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-02"
references:
