  - type: "database"
    title: "Erdős Problems"
    authors:
      - family-names: "Bloom"
        given-names: "Thomas F."
    url: "https://www.erdosproblems.com/"
    notes: "The problem numbering used throughout this repository (#68, #243, #249, #251, #257, #269, #1041, #1049) is the numbering of this database, and the prior-art antecedents recorded in PROBLEMS.md cite its per-problem comment threads by problem number and comment date."
  - type: "software"
    title: "Plectis public formal-mathematics corpus"
    authors:
      - family-names: "Cook"
        given-names: "Will"
    repository-code: "https://github.com/wcook04/plectis-lean-erdos249-257"
    notes: "The companion public corpus. It carries the reviewed claim registry, the declaration atlas and the papers behind these entries; this repository is its Comparator and Palomar release projection at one commit."
